{"id":"7d6e82f8b4b6d41d","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-term-model.md","title":"df-term-model","display":"df-term-model","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-df-term-model","aliases":["16-df-term-model","Syntactic term model"],"display":"df-term-model","depends_on":["[[16-df-dtt-signature]]"],"review_status":"verified-explicit-strong-fragment","review_priority":"P1","review_note_id":"J02","review_date":"2026-10-20","revision_date":"2026-10-20","source":"§10.3 pp.602–608 (PDF 622–628); §10.4 pp.612–613 (PDF 632–633)","formalization_scope":"Coherent simultaneous quotient of contexts, substitutions, types and terms for the selected strong fragment","verification_basis":"Context conversion, equality functionality and substitution induction; no hidden representative choice"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-term-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-term-model</span><span>Syntactic term model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-term-model"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3b1238220cc5942f\" href=\"?note=3b1238220cc5942f\" title=\"16-df-dtt-signature\">16-df-dtt-signature</a></span></div>"},{"key":"review_status","html":"verified-explicit-strong-fragment"},{"key":"review_priority","html":"P1"},{"key":"review_note_id","html":"J02"},{"key":"review_date","html":"2026-10-20"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-20"},{"key":"source","html":"§10.3 pp.602–608 (PDF 622–628); §10.4 pp.612–613 (PDF 632–633)"},{"key":"formalization_scope","html":"Coherent simultaneous quotient of contexts, substitutions, types and terms for the selected strong fragment"},{"key":"verification_basis","html":"Context conversion, equality functionality and substitution induction; no hidden representative choice"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-term-model-—-含跨代表运输的强-DTT-项模型\">df-term-model — 含跨代表运输的强 DTT 项模型</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DTTSig}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{DTTSig}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>；原始语法、判断相等及替换见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3b1238220cc5942f\" href=\"?note=3b1238220cc5942f\" title=\"16-df-dtt-signature\">16-df-dtt-signature</a>。本文件使用其 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1,\\Pi\">\\(1,\\Pi\\)</span>、强 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span>、强 Eq 片段。</li>\n<li>以下 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf C\">\\(\\mathsf C\\)</span> 是良构原始语境集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf S\">\\(\\mathsf S\\)</span> 是良型原始替换三元组集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf A\">\\(\\mathsf A\\)</span> 是良型语境/类型二元组集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf E\">\\(\\mathsf E\\)</span> 是良型语境/类型/项三元组集。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[z]\">\\([z]\\)</span> 按相应关系取商；同一式内总可先通过语境转换将代表放在相同的规范自由变量表中。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_\\Sigma\">\\(\\equiv_\\Sigma\\)</span> 与逐分量替换判断 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma\\sigma=\\tau:\\Delta\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma\\sigma=\\tau:\\Delta\\)</span> 使用上游的完整定义。所有出现的单扩张变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 均取规范位置 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_{|\\Gamma|+1}\">\\(x_{|\\Gamma|+1}\\)</span>，并先对内部绑定变量作新鲜换名。语法构造在商上的操作由下面的代表公式给出，不预设其代表无关性。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf C&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\Gamma\\mid\\Sigma\\vdash\\Gamma\\ \\mathsf{ctx}\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf S&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\sigma)\\mid\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathsf C\\ \\land\\ \\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma\\sigma:\\Delta\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf A&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\Gamma,A)\\mid\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf C\\ \\land\\ \\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma A:\\mathsf{Ty}\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf E&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\Gamma,A,a)\\mid\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf C\\ \\land\\ \\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma a:A\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf C&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\Gamma\\mid\\Sigma\\vdash\\Gamma\\ \\mathsf{ctx}\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf S&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\sigma)\\mid\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathsf C\\ \\land\\ \\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma\\sigma:\\Delta\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf A&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\Gamma,A)\\mid\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf C\\ \\land\\ \\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma A:\\mathsf{Ty}\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf E&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\Gamma,A,a)\\mid\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf C\\ \\land\\ \\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma a:A\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\sigma)\\sim_S(\\Gamma&#39;,\\Delta&#39;,\\tau)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\sigma),(\\Gamma&#39;,\\Delta&#39;,\\tau)\\in\\mathsf S\\ \\land\\\n\\Gamma\\equiv_\\Sigma\\Gamma&#39;\\ \\land\\ \\Delta\\equiv_\\Sigma\\Delta&#39;\\ \\land\\ \\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma\\sigma=\\tau:\\Delta,\\\\\n(\\Gamma,A)\\sim_A(\\Gamma&#39;,B)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n(\\Gamma,A),(\\Gamma&#39;,B)\\in\\mathsf A\\ \\land\\\n\\Gamma\\equiv_\\Sigma\\Gamma&#39;\\ \\land\\ \\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma A=B:\\mathsf{Ty},\\\\\n(\\Gamma,A,a)\\sim_E(\\Gamma&#39;,B,b)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n(\\Gamma,A,a),(\\Gamma&#39;,B,b)\\in\\mathsf E\\ \\land\\\n\\Gamma\\equiv_\\Sigma\\Gamma&#39;\\ \\land\\ \\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma A=B:\\mathsf{Ty}\\ \\land\\ \\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma a=b:A.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\sigma)\\sim_S(\\Gamma&#39;,\\Delta&#39;,\\tau)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\sigma),(\\Gamma&#39;,\\Delta&#39;,\\tau)\\in\\mathsf S\\ \\land\\\n\\Gamma\\equiv_\\Sigma\\Gamma&#39;\\ \\land\\ \\Delta\\equiv_\\Sigma\\Delta&#39;\\ \\land\\ \\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma\\sigma=\\tau:\\Delta,\\\\\n(\\Gamma,A)\\sim_A(\\Gamma&#39;,B)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n(\\Gamma,A),(\\Gamma&#39;,B)\\in\\mathsf A\\ \\land\\\n\\Gamma\\equiv_\\Sigma\\Gamma&#39;\\ \\land\\ \\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma A=B:\\mathsf{Ty},\\\\\n(\\Gamma,A,a)\\sim_E(\\Gamma&#39;,B,b)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n(\\Gamma,A,a),(\\Gamma&#39;,B,b)\\in\\mathsf E\\ \\land\\\n\\Gamma\\equiv_\\Sigma\\Gamma&#39;\\ \\land\\ \\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma A=B:\\mathsf{Ty}\\ \\land\\ \\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma a=b:A.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C_\\Sigma&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf C/{\\equiv_\\Sigma},\\\\\n\\mathcal C_\\Sigma([\\Gamma],[\\Delta])&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{[(\\Gamma&#39;,\\Delta&#39;,\\sigma)]_{\\sim_S}\\mid(\\Gamma&#39;,\\Delta&#39;,\\sigma)\\in\\mathsf S\\ \\land\\ \\Gamma&#39;\\equiv_\\Sigma\\Gamma\\ \\land\\ \\Delta&#39;\\equiv_\\Sigma\\Delta\\},\\\\\n[(\\Delta&#39;,\\Theta,\\tau)]\\circ[(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\sigma)]&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,\\Theta,\\tau[\\sigma])]\n\\quad(\\Delta\\equiv_\\Sigma\\Delta&#39;),\\\\\n\\operatorname{id}_{[\\Gamma]}&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,\\Gamma,(x_1,\\ldots,x_{|\\Gamma|}))],\\qquad\\mathbf1_\\Sigma\\coloneqq[()].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C_\\Sigma&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf C/{\\equiv_\\Sigma},\\\\\n\\mathcal C_\\Sigma([\\Gamma],[\\Delta])&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{[(\\Gamma&#39;,\\Delta&#39;,\\sigma)]_{\\sim_S}\\mid(\\Gamma&#39;,\\Delta&#39;,\\sigma)\\in\\mathsf S\\ \\land\\ \\Gamma&#39;\\equiv_\\Sigma\\Gamma\\ \\land\\ \\Delta&#39;\\equiv_\\Sigma\\Delta\\},\\\\\n[(\\Delta&#39;,\\Theta,\\tau)]\\circ[(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\sigma)]&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,\\Theta,\\tau[\\sigma])]\n\\quad(\\Delta\\equiv_\\Sigma\\Delta&#39;),\\\\\n\\operatorname{id}_{[\\Gamma]}&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,\\Gamma,(x_1,\\ldots,x_{|\\Gamma|}))],\\qquad\\mathbf1_\\Sigma\\coloneqq[()].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nM_\\Sigma&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf S/{\\sim_S},\\\\\ns_\\Sigma([(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\sigma)])&amp;\\coloneqq[\\Gamma],\\qquad\nt_\\Sigma([(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\sigma)])\\coloneqq[\\Delta],\\\\\ne_\\Sigma([\\Gamma])&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{id}_{[\\Gamma]},\\qquad\nc_\\Sigma(g,f)\\coloneqq g\\circ f,\\\\\n\\mathcal C_\\Sigma&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\mathsf C/{\\equiv_\\Sigma},M_\\Sigma,s_\\Sigma,t_\\Sigma,e_\\Sigma,c_\\Sigma\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nM_\\Sigma&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf S/{\\sim_S},\\\\\ns_\\Sigma([(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\sigma)])&amp;\\coloneqq[\\Gamma],\\qquad\nt_\\Sigma([(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\sigma)])\\coloneqq[\\Delta],\\\\\ne_\\Sigma([\\Gamma])&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{id}_{[\\Gamma]},\\qquad\nc_\\Sigma(g,f)\\coloneqq g\\circ f,\\\\\n\\mathcal C_\\Sigma&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\mathsf C/{\\equiv_\\Sigma},M_\\Sigma,s_\\Sigma,t_\\Sigma,e_\\Sigma,c_\\Sigma\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Ty}_\\Sigma([\\Gamma])&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{[(\\Gamma&#39;,A)]_{\\sim_A}\\mid(\\Gamma&#39;,A)\\in\\mathsf A\\ \\land\\ \\Gamma&#39;\\equiv_\\Sigma\\Gamma\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Tm}_\\Sigma([\\Gamma],[(\\Gamma,A)])&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{[(\\Gamma&#39;,B,a)]_{\\sim_E}\\mid(\\Gamma&#39;,B,a)\\in\\mathsf E\\ \\land\\ (\\Gamma&#39;,B)\\sim_A(\\Gamma,A)\\},\\\\\n[(\\Delta,A)][(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\sigma)]&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,A[\\sigma])],\\\\\n[(\\Delta,A,a)][(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\sigma)]&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,A[\\sigma],a[\\sigma])],\\\\\n[\\Gamma].[(\\Gamma,A)]&amp;\\coloneqq[\\Gamma,x_{|\\Gamma|+1}:A],\\\\\np_{[(\\Gamma,A)]}&amp;\\coloneqq[((\\Gamma,x:A),\\Gamma,(x_1,\\ldots,x_{|\\Gamma|}))],\\\\\nq_{[(\\Gamma,A)]}&amp;\\coloneqq[((\\Gamma,x:A),A,x)],\\\\\n\\langle[(\\Delta,\\Gamma,\\sigma)],[(\\Delta,A[\\sigma],a)]\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Delta,(\\Gamma,x:A),(\\sigma,a))].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Ty}_\\Sigma([\\Gamma])&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{[(\\Gamma&#39;,A)]_{\\sim_A}\\mid(\\Gamma&#39;,A)\\in\\mathsf A\\ \\land\\ \\Gamma&#39;\\equiv_\\Sigma\\Gamma\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Tm}_\\Sigma([\\Gamma],[(\\Gamma,A)])&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{[(\\Gamma&#39;,B,a)]_{\\sim_E}\\mid(\\Gamma&#39;,B,a)\\in\\mathsf E\\ \\land\\ (\\Gamma&#39;,B)\\sim_A(\\Gamma,A)\\},\\\\\n[(\\Delta,A)][(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\sigma)]&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,A[\\sigma])],\\\\\n[(\\Delta,A,a)][(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\sigma)]&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,A[\\sigma],a[\\sigma])],\\\\\n[\\Gamma].[(\\Gamma,A)]&amp;\\coloneqq[\\Gamma,x_{|\\Gamma|+1}:A],\\\\\np_{[(\\Gamma,A)]}&amp;\\coloneqq[((\\Gamma,x:A),\\Gamma,(x_1,\\ldots,x_{|\\Gamma|}))],\\\\\nq_{[(\\Gamma,A)]}&amp;\\coloneqq[((\\Gamma,x:A),A,x)],\\\\\n\\langle[(\\Delta,\\Gamma,\\sigma)],[(\\Delta,A[\\sigma],a)]\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Delta,(\\Gamma,x:A),(\\sigma,a))].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n1_{[\\Gamma]}&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,1)],&amp; *_{[\\Gamma]}&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,1,*)],\\\\\n\\mathcal B([(\\Gamma,A)],[((\\Gamma,x:A),B)])&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,\\mathcal B(x:A).B)]\n&amp;&amp;\\bigl(\\mathcal B\\in\\{\\Pi,\\Sigma\\}\\bigr),\\\\\n\\lambda_{[(\\Gamma,A)],[((\\Gamma,x:A),B)]}([((\\Gamma,x:A),B,b)])&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,\\Pi(x:A).B,\\lambda_{A,x.B}(x.b))],\\\\\n\\operatorname{app}_{[(\\Gamma,A)],[((\\Gamma,x:A),B)]}([(\\Gamma,\\Pi(x:A).B,f)],[(\\Gamma,A,a)])&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,B[a/x],\\operatorname{app}_{A,x.B}(f,a))],\\\\\n\\operatorname{pair}_{[(\\Gamma,A)],[((\\Gamma,x:A),B)]}([(\\Gamma,A,a)],[(\\Gamma,B[a/x],b)])&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,\\Sigma(x:A).B,\\operatorname{pair}_{A,x.B}(a,b))],\\\\\n\\operatorname{fst}_{[(\\Gamma,A)],[((\\Gamma,x:A),B)]}([(\\Gamma,\\Sigma(x:A).B,P)])&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,A,\\operatorname{fst}_{A,x.B}(P))],\\\\\n\\operatorname{snd}_{[(\\Gamma,A)],[((\\Gamma,x:A),B)]}([(\\Gamma,\\Sigma(x:A).B,P)])&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,B[\\operatorname{fst}_{A,x.B}(P)/x],\\operatorname{snd}_{A,x.B}(P))],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Eq}([(\\Gamma,A)],[(\\Gamma,A,a)],[(\\Gamma,A,b)])&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,\\operatorname{Eq}_A(a,b))],\\\\\n\\operatorname{refl}([(\\Gamma,A)],[(\\Gamma,A,a)])&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,\\operatorname{Eq}_A(a,a),\\operatorname{refl}(A,a))],\\\\\n\\rho_\\Sigma(c)&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Delta,c(x_1,\\ldots,x_{|\\Delta|}))]\n&amp;&amp;\\bigl((c:\\Delta\\Rightarrow\\mathsf{Ty})\\in\\Sigma\\bigr),\\\\\n\\rho_\\Sigma(d)&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Delta,A,d(x_1,\\ldots,x_{|\\Delta|}))]\n&amp;&amp;\\bigl((d:\\Delta\\Rightarrow A)\\in\\Sigma\\bigr),\\\\\nS_\\Sigma&amp;\\coloneqq(\\mathcal C_\\Sigma,\\operatorname{Ty}_\\Sigma,\\operatorname{Tm}_\\Sigma,\n[-],\\mathbf1_\\Sigma,!,(-).(-),p,q,\\langle-,-\\rangle,1,*,\\Pi,\\lambda,\\operatorname{app},\\Sigma,\\operatorname{pair},\\operatorname{fst},\\operatorname{snd},\\operatorname{Eq},\\operatorname{refl}),\\\\\n!_{[\\Gamma]}&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,(),())],\\qquad\\mathcal T_\\Sigma\\coloneqq(S_\\Sigma,\\rho_\\Sigma).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n1_{[\\Gamma]}&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,1)],&amp; *_{[\\Gamma]}&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,1,*)],\\\\\n\\mathcal B([(\\Gamma,A)],[((\\Gamma,x:A),B)])&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,\\mathcal B(x:A).B)]\n&amp;&amp;\\bigl(\\mathcal B\\in\\{\\Pi,\\Sigma\\}\\bigr),\\\\\n\\lambda_{[(\\Gamma,A)],[((\\Gamma,x:A),B)]}([((\\Gamma,x:A),B,b)])&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,\\Pi(x:A).B,\\lambda_{A,x.B}(x.b))],\\\\\n\\operatorname{app}_{[(\\Gamma,A)],[((\\Gamma,x:A),B)]}([(\\Gamma,\\Pi(x:A).B,f)],[(\\Gamma,A,a)])&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,B[a/x],\\operatorname{app}_{A,x.B}(f,a))],\\\\\n\\operatorname{pair}_{[(\\Gamma,A)],[((\\Gamma,x:A),B)]}([(\\Gamma,A,a)],[(\\Gamma,B[a/x],b)])&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,\\Sigma(x:A).B,\\operatorname{pair}_{A,x.B}(a,b))],\\\\\n\\operatorname{fst}_{[(\\Gamma,A)],[((\\Gamma,x:A),B)]}([(\\Gamma,\\Sigma(x:A).B,P)])&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,A,\\operatorname{fst}_{A,x.B}(P))],\\\\\n\\operatorname{snd}_{[(\\Gamma,A)],[((\\Gamma,x:A),B)]}([(\\Gamma,\\Sigma(x:A).B,P)])&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,B[\\operatorname{fst}_{A,x.B}(P)/x],\\operatorname{snd}_{A,x.B}(P))],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Eq}([(\\Gamma,A)],[(\\Gamma,A,a)],[(\\Gamma,A,b)])&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,\\operatorname{Eq}_A(a,b))],\\\\\n\\operatorname{refl}([(\\Gamma,A)],[(\\Gamma,A,a)])&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,\\operatorname{Eq}_A(a,a),\\operatorname{refl}(A,a))],\\\\\n\\rho_\\Sigma(c)&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Delta,c(x_1,\\ldots,x_{|\\Delta|}))]\n&amp;&amp;\\bigl((c:\\Delta\\Rightarrow\\mathsf{Ty})\\in\\Sigma\\bigr),\\\\\n\\rho_\\Sigma(d)&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Delta,A,d(x_1,\\ldots,x_{|\\Delta|}))]\n&amp;&amp;\\bigl((d:\\Delta\\Rightarrow A)\\in\\Sigma\\bigr),\\\\\nS_\\Sigma&amp;\\coloneqq(\\mathcal C_\\Sigma,\\operatorname{Ty}_\\Sigma,\\operatorname{Tm}_\\Sigma,\n[-],\\mathbf1_\\Sigma,!,(-).(-),p,q,\\langle-,-\\rangle,1,*,\\Pi,\\lambda,\\operatorname{app},\\Sigma,\\operatorname{pair},\\operatorname{fst},\\operatorname{snd},\\operatorname{Eq},\\operatorname{refl}),\\\\\n!_{[\\Gamma]}&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,(),())],\\qquad\\mathcal T_\\Sigma\\coloneqq(S_\\Sigma,\\rho_\\Sigma).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>相等语境长度相同、变量按位置命名；语境转换使同一原始类型和项可在相等语境间运输。目标语境的各型属逐项转换，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sim_S\">\\(\\sim_S\\)</span> 右侧的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma=\\tau:\\Delta\">\\(\\sigma=\\tau:\\Delta\\)</span> 有意义。类型和项商同时包含语境代表，不能只给对象取商而固定一个未经说明的 Hom。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda,\\operatorname{app},\\operatorname{pair},\\operatorname{fst},\\operatorname{snd}\">\\(\\lambda,\\operatorname{app},\\operatorname{pair},\\operatorname{fst},\\operatorname{snd}\\)</span> 都是以两个类型类为结构参数的函数族；不能从一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi\">\\(\\Pi\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 类型类反推出唯一的分解。例如展示可以加入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi(x:1).B=\\Pi(x:1).C\">\\(\\Pi(x:1).B=\\Pi(x:1).C\\)</span> 而未加入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=C\">\\(B=C\\)</span>。保留指标既允许此类展示，也使操作值无需选择分解。</li>\n<li>关系的自反性、对称性、传递性由判断相等和语境转换归纳得到。替换引理、等式功能性以及构造同余使所有代表公式良定义。类型/项重索引合成、单位由有限树替换的合成、单位证明。配对投影式及 η 是元组的逐项等式，给出语境理解的唯一性。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathcal T_\\Sigma\\)</span> 与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"42b5ac7685998854\" href=\"?note=42b5ac7685998854\" title=\"16-df-context-category\">16-df-context-category</a> 的原始语境范畴呈现不同：这里还对语境的逐型属判断相等取商，并显式规定了全部运输。旧范畴仍可用于 display-map 构造；二者不能在公式中未经说明当成同一记录。这里的商确保类型判断相等引起的语境扩张也严格相等，从而无需选择类型代表来定义 split CwF。</li>\n<li>这一定义的良定义性与强 DTT 结构验证见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ae9fd3f9de3bf0f3\" href=\"?note=ae9fd3f9de3bf0f3\" title=\"16-thm-term-model-initial\">16-thm-term-model-initial</a>。它没有把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathcal T_\\Sigma\\)</span> 的初始性当成定义，也没有把弱相等演算的项偷换成强 Eq 项。</li>\n<li>来源：§10.3 pp.602–608（PDF 622–628），尤其引理 10.3.1；§10.4 pp.612–613（PDF 632–633）。跨语境一致商及严格记录是为补齐原书略述处所做的本次重建。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-term-model-—-含跨代表运输的强-DTT-项模型","text":"df-term-model — 含跨代表运输的强 DTT 项模型","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-dtt-signature","status":"resolved","id":"3b1238220cc5942f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-dtt-signature]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-dtt-signature","status":"resolved","id":"3b1238220cc5942f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DTTSig}(\\Sigma)$；原始语法、判断相等及替换见 [[16-df-dtt-signature]]。本文件使用其 $1,\\Pi$、强 $\\Sigma$、强 Eq 片段。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-context-category","status":"resolved","id":"42b5ac7685998854","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal T_\\Sigma$ 与 [[16-df-context-category]] 的原始语境范畴呈现不同：这里还对语境的逐型属判断相等取商，并显式规定了全部运输。旧范畴仍可用于 display-map 构造；二者不能在公式中未经说明当成同一记录。这里的商确保类型判断相等引起的语境扩张也严格相等，从而无需选择类型代表来定义 split CwF。","embed":false},{"target":"16-thm-term-model-initial","status":"resolved","id":"ae9fd3f9de3bf0f3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"这一定义的良定义性与强 DTT 结构验证见 [[16-thm-term-model-initial]]。它没有把 $\\mathcal T_\\Sigma$ 的初始性当成定义，也没有把弱相等演算的项偷换成强 Eq 项。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{DTTSig}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"1,\\Pi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf E","display":false},{"tex":"[z]","display":false},{"tex":"\\equiv_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma\\sigma=\\tau:\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"x_{|\\Gamma|+1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf C&\\coloneqq\\{\\Gamma\\mid\\Sigma\\vdash\\Gamma\\ \\mathsf{ctx}\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf S&\\coloneqq\\{(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\sigma)\\mid\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathsf C\\ \\land\\ \\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma\\sigma:\\Delta\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf A&\\coloneqq\\{(\\Gamma,A)\\mid\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf C\\ \\land\\ \\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma A:\\mathsf{Ty}\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf E&\\coloneqq\\{(\\Gamma,A,a)\\mid\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf C\\ \\land\\ \\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma a:A\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\sigma)\\sim_S(\\Gamma',\\Delta',\\tau)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\n(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\sigma),(\\Gamma',\\Delta',\\tau)\\in\\mathsf S\\ \\land\\\n\\Gamma\\equiv_\\Sigma\\Gamma'\\ \\land\\ \\Delta\\equiv_\\Sigma\\Delta'\\ \\land\\ \\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma\\sigma=\\tau:\\Delta,\\\\\n(\\Gamma,A)\\sim_A(\\Gamma',B)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\n(\\Gamma,A),(\\Gamma',B)\\in\\mathsf A\\ \\land\\\n\\Gamma\\equiv_\\Sigma\\Gamma'\\ \\land\\ \\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma A=B:\\mathsf{Ty},\\\\\n(\\Gamma,A,a)\\sim_E(\\Gamma',B,b)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\n(\\Gamma,A,a),(\\Gamma',B,b)\\in\\mathsf E\\ \\land\\\n\\Gamma\\equiv_\\Sigma\\Gamma'\\ \\land\\ \\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma A=B:\\mathsf{Ty}\\ \\land\\ \\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma a=b:A.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C_\\Sigma&\\coloneqq\\mathsf C/{\\equiv_\\Sigma},\\\\\n\\mathcal C_\\Sigma([\\Gamma],[\\Delta])&\\coloneqq\n\\{[(\\Gamma',\\Delta',\\sigma)]_{\\sim_S}\\mid(\\Gamma',\\Delta',\\sigma)\\in\\mathsf S\\ \\land\\ \\Gamma'\\equiv_\\Sigma\\Gamma\\ \\land\\ \\Delta'\\equiv_\\Sigma\\Delta\\},\\\\\n[(\\Delta',\\Theta,\\tau)]\\circ[(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\sigma)]&\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,\\Theta,\\tau[\\sigma])]\n\\quad(\\Delta\\equiv_\\Sigma\\Delta'),\\\\\n\\operatorname{id}_{[\\Gamma]}&\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,\\Gamma,(x_1,\\ldots,x_{|\\Gamma|}))],\\qquad\\mathbf1_\\Sigma\\coloneqq[()].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nM_\\Sigma&\\coloneqq\\mathsf S/{\\sim_S},\\\\\ns_\\Sigma([(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\sigma)])&\\coloneqq[\\Gamma],\\qquad\nt_\\Sigma([(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\sigma)])\\coloneqq[\\Delta],\\\\\ne_\\Sigma([\\Gamma])&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{id}_{[\\Gamma]},\\qquad\nc_\\Sigma(g,f)\\coloneqq g\\circ f,\\\\\n\\mathcal C_\\Sigma&\\coloneqq\\langle\\mathsf C/{\\equiv_\\Sigma},M_\\Sigma,s_\\Sigma,t_\\Sigma,e_\\Sigma,c_\\Sigma\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Ty}_\\Sigma([\\Gamma])&\\coloneqq\n\\{[(\\Gamma',A)]_{\\sim_A}\\mid(\\Gamma',A)\\in\\mathsf A\\ \\land\\ \\Gamma'\\equiv_\\Sigma\\Gamma\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Tm}_\\Sigma([\\Gamma],[(\\Gamma,A)])&\\coloneqq\n\\{[(\\Gamma',B,a)]_{\\sim_E}\\mid(\\Gamma',B,a)\\in\\mathsf E\\ \\land\\ (\\Gamma',B)\\sim_A(\\Gamma,A)\\},\\\\\n[(\\Delta,A)][(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\sigma)]&\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,A[\\sigma])],\\\\\n[(\\Delta,A,a)][(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\sigma)]&\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,A[\\sigma],a[\\sigma])],\\\\\n[\\Gamma].[(\\Gamma,A)]&\\coloneqq[\\Gamma,x_{|\\Gamma|+1}:A],\\\\\np_{[(\\Gamma,A)]}&\\coloneqq[((\\Gamma,x:A),\\Gamma,(x_1,\\ldots,x_{|\\Gamma|}))],\\\\\nq_{[(\\Gamma,A)]}&\\coloneqq[((\\Gamma,x:A),A,x)],\\\\\n\\langle[(\\Delta,\\Gamma,\\sigma)],[(\\Delta,A[\\sigma],a)]\\rangle&\\coloneqq[(\\Delta,(\\Gamma,x:A),(\\sigma,a))].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n1_{[\\Gamma]}&\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,1)],& *_{[\\Gamma]}&\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,1,*)],\\\\\n\\mathcal B([(\\Gamma,A)],[((\\Gamma,x:A),B)])&\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,\\mathcal B(x:A).B)]\n&&\\bigl(\\mathcal B\\in\\{\\Pi,\\Sigma\\}\\bigr),\\\\\n\\lambda_{[(\\Gamma,A)],[((\\Gamma,x:A),B)]}([((\\Gamma,x:A),B,b)])&\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,\\Pi(x:A).B,\\lambda_{A,x.B}(x.b))],\\\\\n\\operatorname{app}_{[(\\Gamma,A)],[((\\Gamma,x:A),B)]}([(\\Gamma,\\Pi(x:A).B,f)],[(\\Gamma,A,a)])&\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,B[a/x],\\operatorname{app}_{A,x.B}(f,a))],\\\\\n\\operatorname{pair}_{[(\\Gamma,A)],[((\\Gamma,x:A),B)]}([(\\Gamma,A,a)],[(\\Gamma,B[a/x],b)])&\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,\\Sigma(x:A).B,\\operatorname{pair}_{A,x.B}(a,b))],\\\\\n\\operatorname{fst}_{[(\\Gamma,A)],[((\\Gamma,x:A),B)]}([(\\Gamma,\\Sigma(x:A).B,P)])&\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,A,\\operatorname{fst}_{A,x.B}(P))],\\\\\n\\operatorname{snd}_{[(\\Gamma,A)],[((\\Gamma,x:A),B)]}([(\\Gamma,\\Sigma(x:A).B,P)])&\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,B[\\operatorname{fst}_{A,x.B}(P)/x],\\operatorname{snd}_{A,x.B}(P))],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Eq}([(\\Gamma,A)],[(\\Gamma,A,a)],[(\\Gamma,A,b)])&\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,\\operatorname{Eq}_A(a,b))],\\\\\n\\operatorname{refl}([(\\Gamma,A)],[(\\Gamma,A,a)])&\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,\\operatorname{Eq}_A(a,a),\\operatorname{refl}(A,a))],\\\\\n\\rho_\\Sigma(c)&\\coloneqq[(\\Delta,c(x_1,\\ldots,x_{|\\Delta|}))]\n&&\\bigl((c:\\Delta\\Rightarrow\\mathsf{Ty})\\in\\Sigma\\bigr),\\\\\n\\rho_\\Sigma(d)&\\coloneqq[(\\Delta,A,d(x_1,\\ldots,x_{|\\Delta|}))]\n&&\\bigl((d:\\Delta\\Rightarrow A)\\in\\Sigma\\bigr),\\\\\nS_\\Sigma&\\coloneqq(\\mathcal C_\\Sigma,\\operatorname{Ty}_\\Sigma,\\operatorname{Tm}_\\Sigma,\n[-],\\mathbf1_\\Sigma,!,(-).(-),p,q,\\langle-,-\\rangle,1,*,\\Pi,\\lambda,\\operatorname{app},\\Sigma,\\operatorname{pair},\\operatorname{fst},\\operatorname{snd},\\operatorname{Eq},\\operatorname{refl}),\\\\\n!_{[\\Gamma]}&\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,(),())],\\qquad\\mathcal T_\\Sigma\\coloneqq(S_\\Sigma,\\rho_\\Sigma).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\sim_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma=\\tau:\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda,\\operatorname{app},\\operatorname{pair},\\operatorname{fst},\\operatorname{snd}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi(x:1).B=\\Pi(x:1).C","display":false},{"tex":"B=C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T_\\Sigma","display":false}],"bytes":8077,"backlinks":[{"id":"64dd825bd60fb1b8","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2cbe3d8d855b52d0","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"源靶标签、恒等和复合均已明确写出；理解元素范畴不再依靠自然语言中的惯例。这里仍是在原始良构语境范畴上的项预层，与 [[16-df-term-model]] 的同时取商语境呈现不同。"},{"id":"d2537c53f3e071c1","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DTTSig}(\\Sigma)$ 取 [[16-df-term-model]] 所使用的有限强一阶展示；$\\mathcal T_\\Sigma$ 为该文件完整定义的项模型。$\\mathcal T_\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{legacy}}$ 为本文件引入的兼容记号。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-86","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-dtt-signature]]、[[16-df-split-dtt-structure]]、[[16-df-dtt-model]]、[[16-df-dtt-model-morphism]]、[[16-df-term-model]]、[[16-thm-term-model-initial]]、[[16-df-dtt-internal-language]]、[[16-thm-internal-language]]、[[16-thm-dtt-completeness]]、[[16-df-identity-type]]、[[16-df-identity-relative-equality]]、[[16-df-fhodtt-syntax]]、[[16-df-fhodtt-terms]]、[[16-df-split-fhodtt-structure]]、[[16-df-fhodtt-term-model]]、[[16-thm-fhodtt-soundness]]、[[16-thm-fhodtt-completeness]]、[[16-prop-fhodtt-kind-reflection]]。DTT 结果使用明确的强片段与严格态射；FHoDTT 的可靠性和完备性使用匹配其语法的两 sort 严格模型。内部语言评价是否覆盖整个模型，由语境生成条件判定。"},{"id":"78b06d051d0fb2fc","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"模型及相等有效性为 [[16-df-dtt-model]] 的 $\\mathrm{DTTModel}_\\Sigma(M)$ 与 $M\\models J$。$\\mathcal T_\\Sigma$ 是 [[16-df-term-model]] 的句法模型；其可靠性与模型性见 [[16-thm-term-model-initial]]。"},{"id":"ae9fd3f9de3bf0f3","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DTTSig}(\\Sigma)$ 使用 [[16-df-dtt-signature]] 的有限强一阶展示。$\\mathcal T_\\Sigma$ 为 [[16-df-term-model]] 的一致商记录。"}],"outgoing":["3b1238220cc5942f","42b5ac7685998854","ae9fd3f9de3bf0f3"]}